flowchart TD
  A[Start — No Suggestions Yet] --> B[Input Keywords + Number]
  B --> C[Press "Suggest New Assets"]
  C --> D[Table of New Suggestions]

  D -->|Approve| E1[Fade Row → Move to Pre-Approved Section]
  D -->|Decline| E2[Fade Row → Move to Declined Section]
  D -->|Delete| F[Fade Row → Permanently Removed]
  D -->|Blacklist| G[Fade Row → Add to Blacklist + Remove]

  E1 -->|Optional Undo| D
  E2 -->|Optional Undo| D

  E1 --> H[Button: "Begin Deep Curation 🚀"]
  H --> CuratePage[Curate Page — Deep Curation Starts!]


flowchart TD
  SUGGESTED[SuggestedAsset<br>approved=False<br>retrieved=False<br>ingested=False]
  PREAPPROVED[Pre-Approved<br>approved=True<br>retrieved=True<br>ingested=False]
  CURATED[Curated (Deep Curated)<br>approved=True<br>retrieved=True<br>ingested=False]
  INGESTED[Ingested<br>approved=True<br>retrieved=True<br>ingested=True]

  SUGGESTED -->|Pre-Approve (fetch full text)| PREAPPROVED
  PREAPPROVED -->|Deep Curation Metadata| CURATED
  CURATED -->|Final Approve + Ingest| INGESTED